{"seq":4,"slug":"forestry-management","title":"森林经营与利用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forestry-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"forest-mensuration-and-inventory","title":"大学林学 — 森林测计与资源调查","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forestry-management/forest-mensuration-and-inventory","wordCount":1998,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"harvesting-and-forest-regeneration","title":"大学林学 — 采伐与森林更新","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forestry-management/harvesting-and-forest-regeneration","wordCount":2147,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"forest-carbon-and-sustainable-management","title":"大学林学 — 森林碳汇与可持续经营","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forestry-management/forest-carbon-and-sustainable-management","wordCount":2147,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"森林经营与利用\">森林经营与利用</h1><p>森林既要保护，也要合理利用——人类需要木材、需要碳汇、需要森林创造的财富。森林经营与利用研究的是如何在&quot;取&quot;与&quot;养&quot;之间找到可持续的平衡，让森林既能产出效益，又能永续不衰。这是林学从&quot;科学&quot;走向&quot;产业&quot;和&quot;治理&quot;的落脚点。</p>\n<p>本章包含三个主题。<strong>森林测计与资源调查</strong> 讲解如何测量和估算森林的&quot;家底&quot;——蓄积量与生长量，这是一切经营决策的数据基础；<strong>采伐与森林更新</strong> 探讨如何科学地采收木材并让森林及时再生；<strong>森林碳汇与可持续经营</strong> 立足气候时代，讨论森林固碳的价值变现与永续经营的现代理念。</p>\n"}